  <justification>
    <existing>`TenantAuthorizationFilter` already exists and already binds tenant for four request types (`:106-141`); `AuthorizeRowsAsync` / document authorization already exists for per-row checks.</existing>
    <extension>Yes — extend both existing mechanisms to cover this request type. No new component. The new test file is new surface only because no authorization test covers this route today.</extension>
    <cost-of-doing-nothing>A caller writes index chunks into another tenant's partition and stamps Dataverse rows they cannot write — the exact tenant-isolation failure NFR-02 exists to prevent.</cost-of-doing-nothing>
  </justification>

